# Claude Code's working directory. Nothing in it has ever been tracked, and
# `.claude/worktrees/` is where isolated agent worktrees land -- inside the
# repo, as whole nested git repositories. Without this line a `git add -A`
# commits one as an embedded repo (mode 160000), which is how it got in once.
.claude/

# Per-session handoff notes: volatile state and machine-specific paths,
# deliberately never committed. The durable rules that used to live in it are
# in the tracked CLAUDE.md instead. Ignored so that an entry in `git status`
# keeps meaning something, which is the point of the two rules above.
HANDOFF.md
